## dbt project

- Path: `dbt_analytics/`
- Layers: `models/1_staging/` → `2_base/` → `3_core/` → `4_intermediate/` → `5_marts/`
- Run from repo root: `dbt <command> --project-dir dbt_analytics --profiles-dir .`

## Ingestion

- Raw parquet to `storage/raw/{market_code}/`
- No business logic in ingestion — raw fields only
